## Inline comments

### `src/holodeck/safety.c:200`

--- 0b75bb42-dee8-86c3-b802-bc72e8807da8
<div id="m-0b75bb42-dee8-86c3-b802-bc72e8807da8" data-section-uuid="0b75bb42-dee8-86c3-b802-bc72e8807da8" class="msg msg--github">

[data-soong](datalib:handle/github/data-soong "data-soong") · <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2369-04-15T14:00:01Z" title="2369-04-15 14:00:01 UTC">Tue Apr 15th, 2369 at 14:00</time> <a class="source-link" href="https://github.com/enterprise-d/replicator-firmware/pull/43#discussion_r4300301" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">↗</a>

If `safeties_engaged` is read after `weapons_armed` is set, there is a 12-microsecond window in which a discharge could occur. I recommend reordering the checks.

</div>

--- -
